    "Description": "The Audio File library is an implementation of the Audio File Library from SGI, which provides an API for accessing audio file formats like AIFF/AIFF-C, WAVE, and NeXT/Sun .snd/.au files. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* audiofile: NULL pointer dereference in the ModuleState::setup function (CVE-2025-50950)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
